+
+## Dependencies
+
+### External Dependencies
+
+- No external service, library, or prior epic dependency is specified in the available artifacts.
+
+### Inter-Story Dependencies
+
+| Story | Depends On | Provides To |
+|------|------------|-------------|
+| S001 | — | S002 |
+| S002 | S001 | S003 |
+| S003 | S002 | — |
+
+---
+
+## Risk Mitigation
+
+| Story | Risk | Mitigation |
+|------|------|------------|
+| S001 | Transcript leakage between workspaces | Make workspace association part of capture and retrieval behavior. |
+| S002 | Async output loses workspace ownership | Carry the transcript's workspace association into every proposed action. |
+| S003 | An incomplete or accidental action becomes a commitment | Require explicit confirmation plus text, owner, future `due_at`, confirmer, and timestamp. |
+
